tellung. Auch Micky bleibt von Überraschungen nicht verschont. A- und B-Hörnchen halten ihn und Pluto am Heiligen Abend mit ihren Streichen ganz schön auf Trab. Die Weihnachtsgeschichten von Walt Disney mit Micky und seinen Freunden bieten allen eine bezaubernde Bescherung. Ein unvergessliches Weihnachtserlebnis für jung und alt.","poster":"/sCass1I85aNLrOTH5MQORftOLum.jpg","runtime":26.0,"title":"Micky's Weihnachtserzählung","type":"movie","va":7.7,"vc":1023,"year":"1983"},"movie:16877":{"cast":[{"id":42276,"name":"Rupert Penry-Jones","photo":"/50mfkdU5TY8nHuz7vXCz60ywg2c.jpg"},{"id":82807,"name":"Lydia Leonard","photo":"/hZyocFIvGrZxJD3sDxAtWvMjDyJ.jpg"},{"id":26717,"name":"David Haig","photo":"/dRlqWCY89CRCfDMYRSSPpZbK6f2.jpg"},{"id":8979,"name":"Patrick Malahide","photo":"/ae0AJ8FbJireYPQyglIxNucjqIy.jpg"},{"id":14432,"name":"Patrick Kennedy","photo":"/Aj7lwhi4rYfzP5OZJiem5w72re8.jpg"},{"id":1665,"name":"Eddie Marsan","photo":"/9atfOgIxhfOKvv2be8HEp6SzOct.jpg"},{"id":15739,"name":"Alex Jennings","photo":"/4nbbUmAwoOCarkR5FHJjzw2STPE.jpg"},{"id":80371,"name":"Steven Elder","photo":"/nEfyzjSe43laenyiDUj2JEDT6Nt.jpg"}],"genres":["Thriller","Mystery","Abenteuer","TV-Film"],"id":16877,"original":"The 39 Steps","overview":"","poster":"/8N537ufRENaGUEJR0JTrRoK93rR.jpg","runtime":90.0,"title":"The 39 Steps","type":"movie","va":6.5,"vc":28,"year":"2008"},"movie:17966":{"cast":[{"id":13566,"name":"Edward G. Robinson","photo":"/UkZdBmDs7Qw8caX7PlF1Spk8kR.jpg"},{"id":5788,"name":"James Cagney","photo":"/haDKecHGGb1qh8gAoR3ExiJlujn.jpg"},{"id":103500,"name":"Evalyn Knapp","photo":"/cilvATKn7SWghVG8poLcJaiSOqc.jpg"},{"id":101886,"name":"Ralf Harolde","photo":"/3SphHINjbpRSzw7zhVYeKVvfo4T.jpg"},{"id":104800,"name":"Noel Francis","photo":"/5TVrrZyK0TV3H4m1DTkGx4N8etL.jpg"},{"id":9089,"name":"Margaret Livingston","photo":"/gkLkBJMDjm3AFo8CUmMZDgAKMGD.jpg"},{"id":101890,"name":"Maurice Black","photo":"/1HQfoFmDIXwxE1e3sugCjJnTQQh.jpg"},{"id":85737,"name":"Billy House","photo":"/3