.jpg","runtime":92.0,"title":"Age of the Dragons","type":"movie","va":4.0,"vc":114,"year":"2011"},"movie:64836":{"cast":[{"id":179632,"name":"Phil Rosenthal","photo":"/rR1dZHdTuCsw7wWsGbzdroaggjy.jpg"},{"id":1226147,"name":"Richard Vaczy","photo":""},{"id":5623593,"name":"Елена Стародубцева","photo":""},{"id":2982379,"name":"Шабан Муслимов","photo":""},{"id":3424508,"name":"Michael Lynton","photo":"/mMRqcp6uKZNOivjPmXzcWszw1RL.jpg"},{"id":5623607,"name":"Aleksey Shulgin","photo":""},{"id":2128034,"name":"Екатерина Маракулина","photo":""},{"id":2203028,"name":"Евгений Миллер","photo":"/bzjWGFaOxQif1i9J8YDObZVj2EA.jpg"}],"genres":["Komödie","Dokumentarfilm"],"id":64836,"original":"Exporting Raymond","overview":"","poster":"/9Y6DG9HiwWDhDpAFMyTzwEjgWsO.jpg","runtime":86.0,"title":"Exporting Raymond","type":"movie","va":6.5,"vc":40,"year":"2011"},"movie:68274":{"cast":[{"id":20,"name":"Elizabeth Perkins","photo":"/t9Cfx8R8hxB1Od46s9CXJMwwNTA.jpg"},{"id":12052,"name":"Gwyneth Paltrow","photo":"/r4wbWWEEjmtRFZ0GU10XbLTgp47.jpg"},{"id":3391,"name":"Kathleen Turner","photo":"/hvmMGjWKy1CGmaJzPtOtbb3fD57.jpg"},{"id":2395,"name":"Whoopi Goldberg","photo":"/78LZMMzNUJVfLI1MObxejScwZz5.jpg"},{"id":32362,"name":"Jon Bon Jovi","photo":"/oFZGmABXiBtIlZ9sSOeRNRVAfcs.jpg"},{"id":104799,"name":"Shadia Simmons","photo":"/gIrO7Ql0Nh8kchzW6WF2uyfzISo.jpg"},{"id":1217865,"name":"Erica Luttrell","photo":"/qRsIqCvNf2uUDoKYxNxtW0FxX8r.jpg"},{"id":14792,"name":"Josef Sommer","photo":"/eY3tCB4j7nWhsZX1enU6BYpaZl.jpg"}],"genres":["Komödie","Drama","Liebesfilm"],"id":68274,"original":"Moonlight and Valentino","overview":"Der plötzliche Unfalltod ihres Mannes stürzt Rebecca Lott in eine tiefe Krise. Drei Freundinnen bemühen sich liebevoll, die junge Witwe auf andere Gedanken zu bringen, doch auch sie werden von seelischen Problemen gequät. Sylvie führt eine unglückliche Ehe, ihre Schwester Lucy glaubt, für immer Jungfrau bleiben zu müssen, und Rebeccas Exstiefmutter Alberta verstört durch ihre H